  "content": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/refs/heads/master/image.png\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/refs/heads/master/image.png\" width=\"180\" style=\"border-radius: 12px;\" />\n  </a>\n</p>\n<h1 align=\"center\">Better Crosshairs</h1>\n<p align=\"center\"><em>一款優秀的 Fabric 模組，用於更好的準星自訂。</em></p>\n<hr />\n<table width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"70%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n      <h3>自訂顏色</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>依照你的喜好為準星上色，支援使用十六進位色碼選擇</li>\n      </ul>\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"30%\" align=\"right\" valign=\"top\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/blob/master/screenshots/greencursor.png?raw=true\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/blob/master/screenshots/greencursor.png?raw=true\" width=\"220\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; display: block;\" />\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"70%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n      <h3>自訂縮放</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>調整準星大小，可選擇 1 至 64 像素</li>\n      </ul>\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"30%\" align=\"right\" valign=\"top\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/blob/master/screenshots/giantgreencursor.png?raw=true\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/blob/master/screenshots/giantgreencursor.png?raw=true\" width=\"220\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; display: block;\" />\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"70%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n      <h3>自訂圖示</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>可使用網址、檔案路徑或 Minecraft 識別碼來指定自訂圖示</li>\n      </ul>\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"30%\" align=\"right\" valign=\"top\">\n      <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/refs/heads/master/screenshots/readycursor.png\">\n        <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/refs/heads/master/screenshots/readycursor.png\" width=\"220\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; display: block;\" />\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td width=\"70%\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 16px;\">\n      <h3>目標標示</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>當準星指向其他玩家時，會自動變暗以作為目標提示</li>\n      </ul>\n    </td>\n    <td width=\"30%\" align=\"right\" valign=\"top\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/blob/master/screenshots/graycursor.png?raw=true\">\n        <img src=\"https://github.com/genizy/Better-Crosshairs/blob/master/screenshots/graycursor.png?raw=true\" width=\"220\" style=\"border-radius: 8px; display: block;\" />\n      </a>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
